        <h1>Why Jacob Coxon Resigned <em>From Anthropic</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">He posted seven times, quit a job four months old, and set off the biggest AI safety story of the year. The most quoted fact about him is not true. Here is the full text of what he said, who the ten percent figure really belongs to, and what he is actually asking for.</p>
